---
description: Ruby and Rails engineering rules for maintainable applications, APIs, jobs, and business systems.
globs:
  - "**/*.rb"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Clarify framework, app shape, and job system first.
- Keep controllers thin and business orchestration outside transport layer.
- Avoid model bloat and make job retry/idempotency behavior explicit.

## Cross-Project Standards

新项目启动、设计系统制定或跨页面规范统一时，先读取 `project-standards-playbook/SKILL.md` 及其适用细则；小修复按影响范围应用，保留已有确认参数。
